tore_quinoa" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="How do producers store quinoa">How do producers store quinoa</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Whats_the_best_packaging_for_quinoa" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="What’s the best packaging for quinoa">What’s the best packaging for quinoa</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#How_should_you_store_quinoa_at_home" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="How should you store quinoa at home">How should you store quinoa at home</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Links_about" >Liens sur</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_does_quinoa_spoil"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="How does quinoa spoil">How does quinoa spoil</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Quinoa is a common grain">Quinoa is a common grain</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="rich in nutrients like protein">rich in nutrients like protein</span>, calcium, potassium, phosphore, et fibres alimentaires. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Freshly packed quinoa usually lasts">Freshly packed quinoa usually lasts</span> 18-24 mois. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="As long as it’s sealed and used within the shelf life">As long as it’s sealed and used within the shelf life</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="it’s safe to eat">it’s safe to eat</span>.</p><p>Cependant, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="if stored improperly or beyond its expiration date">if stored improperly or beyond its expiration date</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="it can start to spoil in two ways">it can start to spoil in two ways</span>:</p><ul><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Nutrients may be lost">Nutrients may be lost</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="but it won’t harm your health">but it won’t harm your health</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Harmful substances may form">Harmful substances may form</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="or bugs may infest it">or bugs may infest it</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="Foods often spoil because of their moisture content">Foods often spoil because of their moisture content</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Our quinoa has a moisture content of about">Our quinoa has a moisture content of about</span> 12%, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="which is below China&#8217;s national standard of">which is below China&#8217;s national standard of</span> 13%. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="As long as it’s stored correctly">As long as it’s stored correctly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="it won’t spoil easily">it won’t spoil easily</span>. Cependant, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="if exposed to air for too long">if exposed to air for too long</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="bugs might lay eggs in the quinoa">bugs might lay eggs in the quinoa</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="contaminating it">contaminating it</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_tell_if_quinoa_is_spoiled"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="How to tell if quinoa is spoiled">How to tell if quinoa is spoiled</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="You can usually tell if quinoa has gone bad by using your senses">You can usually tell if quinoa has gone bad by using your senses</span>:</p><ol><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Look">Look</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Pour some quinoa out and check if the grains stick together">Pour some quinoa out and check if the grains stick together</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="If they do">If they do</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="it’s likely infested with bugs">it’s likely infested with bugs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="If you see mold">If you see mold</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="throw it away immediately">throw it away immediately</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="Moldy quinoa is unsafe to eat">Moldy quinoa is unsafe to eat</span>.</li><li><strong>Odeur</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="Quinoa has a distinct scent">Quinoa has a distinct scent</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="but if it smells moldy or off">but if it smells moldy or off</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="it’s likely spoiled">it’s likely spoiled</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="You can compare the smell with fresh quinoa">You can compare the smell with fresh quinoa</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="If it has an unpleasant odor">If it has an unpleasant odor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="don’t eat it">don’t eat it</span>.</li><li><strong>Goût</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="If you can’t tell by looking or smelling">If you can’t tell by looking or smelling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="cook the quinoa and taste a small amount">cook the quinoa and taste a small amount</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="If it tastes off">If it tastes off</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="avoid eating it">avoid eating it</span>.</li></ol><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_happens_when_quinoa_spoils"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="What happens when quinoa spoils">What happens when quinoa spoils</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="If quinoa has expired or was stored improperly">If quinoa has expired or was stored improperly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="nutrient loss isn’t a big issue">nutrient loss isn’t a big issue</span>. Cependant, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="harmful substances">harmful substances</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="like aflatoxins">like aflatoxins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="can form when it spoils">can form when it spoils</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="Aflatoxins are toxic and carcinogenic">Aflatoxins are toxic and carcinogenic</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="If your quinoa is only">If your quinoa is only</span> 1-2 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="months past its expiration date and was sealed">months past its expiration date and was sealed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="it should still be safe to eat">it should still be safe to eat</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="But if you notice mold or a bad smell">But if you notice mold or a bad smell</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="don’t eat it">don’t eat it</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="regardless of the expiration date">regardless of the expiration date</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Quinoa doesn’t spoil quickly">Quinoa doesn’t spoil quickly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="but its nutrients can degrade over time">but its nutrients can degrade over time</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="If your quinoa has been stored for a long time">If your quinoa has been stored for a long time</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="it’s best to buy fresh quinoa">it’s best to buy fresh quinoa</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_do_producers_store_quinoa"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="How do producers store quinoa">How do producers store quinoa</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="As producers">As producers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="we store unprocessed quinoa in">we store unprocessed quinoa in</span> 25 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="kg grain bags in temperature">kg grain bags in temperature</span>- <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="and humidity-controlled warehouses">and humidity-controlled warehouses</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="These warehouses are designed to keep out insects and rodents">These warehouses are designed to keep out insects and rodents</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="By storing quinoa at low temperatures and with moisture control">By storing quinoa at low temperatures and with moisture control</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="it can be preserved for over a year">it can be preserved for over a year</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="When processing is needed">When processing is needed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="we take the quinoa out of storage">we take the quinoa out of storage</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Whats_the_best_packaging_for_quinoa"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="What’s the best packaging for quinoa">What’s the best packaging for quinoa</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="From years of experience">From years of experience</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="the ideal way to package quinoa is in 500g vacuum-sealed bags">the ideal way to package quinoa is in 500g vacuum-sealed bags</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="For bulk sales">For bulk sales</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="we process and deliver quinoa to customers as quickly as possible">we process and deliver quinoa to customers as quickly as possible</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_should_you_store_quinoa_at_home"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="How should you store quinoa at home">How should you store quinoa at home</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Storing quinoa at home is easy">Storing quinoa at home is easy</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="If possible">If possible</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="use a sealed glass container and keep it in the refrigerator">use a sealed glass container and keep it in the refrigerator</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="If space is limited">If space is limited</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="a sealed plastic bag will also work">a sealed plastic bag will also work</span>. Conservez-le au frais, endroit sec.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Links_about"></span>Liens sur<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><a href="/fr/about-us/"><strong><u><b>En savoir plus sur nous</b></u></strong></a></p><p><a href="/fr/products/"><strong><u><b>Trouver des produits</b></u></strong></a></p><p><a href="/fr/contact-us/"><strong><u><b>Contactez-nous</b></u></strong></a></p>`} />
